26:["$","p",null,{"children":["The top-level ",["$","code",null,{"children":"content/docs/meta.json"}]," orders the sections themselves; each\nsection's ",["$","code",null,{"children":"meta.json"}]," gives it the title the sidebar shows. Do not list\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"index"}]," in ",["$","code",null,{"children":"pages"}],": a section's ",["$","code",null,{"children":"index.mdx"}]," becomes the link on the section\ntitle itself, and listing it would show the same page twice."]}]
