3a:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"lint:snippets"}]," closes that gap. It harvests every field name out of the\ngenerated reference, the latest release's page and main's, and checks every\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"json"}],"/",["$","code",null,{"children":"json5"}]," fence under ",["$","code",null,{"children":"content/docs/"}]," against it. A snippet for a field\nadded since the last release passes once ",["$","code",null,{"children":"gen:config-reference main"}]," has\nbeen run in the same change."]}]
